      <p>「それ、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9942-9954"><rb>何</rb><rt>ど</rt></ruby>うだあ。」</p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-9971-9977">と</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-9977-9998"><rb>悦喜</rb><rt>えつき</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-9998-10001">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10001-10028"><rb>顏色</rb><rt>がんしよく</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10028-10033">。</seg></p>
      <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10036-10066"><rb>於是</rb><rt>こゝにおいて</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10066-10090"><rb>村内</rb><rt>そんない</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10090-10093">の</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10093-10117"><rb>惡少</rb><rt>あくせう</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10117-10120">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10120-10135"><rb>誰</rb><rt>たれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10135-10138">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10138-10153"><rb>彼</rb><rt>かれ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10153-10156">も</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10156-10168"><rb>先</rb><rt>ま</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10168-10171">づ</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10171-10186"><rb>一</rb><rt>ひと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10186-10195">ツ、（</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10195-10213"><rb>馬鹿</rb><rt>ばか</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10213-10216">な</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10216-10231"><rb>事</rb><rt>こと</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10231-10263">を）とけなしつける。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-10263-10266">「</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10266-10281"><rb>試</rb><rt>ため</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-10281-10287">して</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10287-10299"><rb>見</rb><rt>み</rt></ruby>ろ。」</p>
      <p>「トおいでなすつた、<ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-10340-10364"><rb>合點</rb><rt>がつてん</rt></ruby>だ。」</p>
